# Run the Bellhaven -> CRM sync every day at 06:15 local time.
# Re-runs are safe: proposals are fingerprinted and anything already approved,
# rejected or applied is never re-queued. New/changed findings land in the review
# queue for a human to approve in the review app (python app.py).
#
#   crontab -e   and paste:
15 6 * * *  cd /path/to/bellhaven-sync && /usr/bin/env python3 -m bellhaven_sync.pipeline >> data/pipeline.log 2>&1
